          "id": "s1n1",
          "who": "lin-narr",
          "en": "My clone promises a dynamic start to the day.",
          "zh": "分身保证，这一天会以充满活力的方式开始。",
          "kw": "dynamic"
        },
        {
          "kind": "line",
          "id": "s1l1",
          "who": "clone",
          "en": "A start full of energy! How long to run, how long to rest — I've planned it all.",
          "zh": "开场要有活力！跑多久、歇多久，我都安排好了。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "line",
          "id": "s1n2",
          "who": "lin-narr",
          "en": "His dream lifestyle comes with a stopwatch.",
          "zh": "他理想的生活方式，连秒表都配好了。",
          "kw": "lifestyle",
          "sfx": "tick"
        },
        {
          "kind": "line",
          "id": "s1n3",
          "who": "lin-narr",
          "en": "Even rest has a time limit.",
          "zh": "就连休息，也有时间限制。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "line",
          "id": "s1l2",
          "who": "lin",
          "en": "Even resting has a countdown? I'll take it and ask everyone first.",
          "zh": "连休息都要倒计时？我先拿去问问大家。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "line",
          "id": "s1l3",
          "who": "clone",
          "en": "I'll wait at home for feedback. Remember, the rest button is this one.",
          "zh": "我在家等反馈。记得，休息键在这边。",
          "sfx": "tap",
          "sfxEnd": "click"
        },
        {
          "kind": "pause",
          "id": "s1-end",
          "frames": 20
        }
      ]
